# Parked for delivery

When the user asks to save something for later / the end / delivery,
add a row to `modulos/vision/pendiente_final.md` in the same turn.
Do not start that work. Do not invent extra parked items.

When they ask what is left, or to close the list, read that file and
remind them of every open row.
